      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city was officially renamed Rhodes on August 3, 1883, after the family that donated land for the Chicago, Milwaukee & St. Paul Railroad.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
